  "Header": "UNT-AOA-V1.0",
  "Group": "Acquisition",
  "Category": "Media",
  "Description": "Audio Object Acquisition: acquires Audio Objects from the real world and provides them, and the Scene Descriptors of what it acquires where the Data Type exists. A microphone or microphone array gives a Basic Audio Object; a source on a disk or a network may give a Basic or a full Audio Object, and Basic or full Scene Descriptors.",
